    "name": "The Undergrounders",
    "steam_appid": 3364120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364120/extras/a7ccf3098ffbe9a629990b3a547bf8d7.poster.avif?t=1744579811\" width=231 height=87 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364120/extras/a7ccf3098ffbe9a629990b3a547bf8d7.webm?t=1744579811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Undergrounders</strong> is a gripping first-person, story-driven thriller that pulls you into a chilling underground world where survival is dictated by ruthless choices and moral dilemmas. Jack, a father desperate to save his daughter, finds himself trapped in a twisted game orchestrated by the Undergrounders, a shadowy group shrouded in mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step he takes unravels a deeper conspiracy, forcing him to confront haunting truths about himself and the people around him. In this world, trust is scarce, and betrayal lurks in the shadows. How far would you go to protect those you love? And what are you willing to sacrifice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you guide Jack to freedom, or will his decisions drag him further into the darkness?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape Jack's journey, unlocking multiple endings that range from heartbreak to grim revelations. Each playthrough unveils new layers of a story steeped in themes of justice, guilt, and the weight of consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364120/extras/f4998e488851c2b862cf692933510fae.poster.avif?t=1744579811\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364120/extras/f4998e488851c2b862cf692933510fae.webm?t=1744579811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364120/extras/f4998e488851c2b862cf692933510fae.mp4?t=1744579811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Rich Narrative</strong>: Dive deep into an emotionally charged storyline that explores themes of justice, guilt, and redemption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong>: Your decisions impact the world around you, leading to different outcomes and consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices Matter</strong>: Every choice you make will have lasting repercussions, forcing you to weigh each decision carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate and Uncover Secrets</strong>: Solve intricate puzzles, explore mysterious environments, and uncover dark truths hidden in the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and Suspenseful Atmosphere</strong>: The game\u2019s haunting atmosphere and eerie environments will keep you on edge as you navigate its dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Sim</strong>: Engage with the world around you and make meaningful interactions that affect the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Puzzle-Solving</strong>: Solve complex puzzles while exploring a world full of secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the underground? The choice is yours, but be prepared for the consequences.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364120/extras/a7ccf3098ffbe9a629990b3a547bf8d7.poster.avif?t=1744579811\" width=231 height=87 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364120/extras/a7ccf3098ffbe9a629990b3a547bf8d7.webm?t=1744579811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Undergrounders</strong> is a gripping first-person, story-driven thriller that pulls you into a chilling underground world where survival is dictated by ruthless choices and moral dilemmas. Jack, a father desperate to save his daughter, finds himself trapped in a twisted game orchestrated by the Undergrounders, a shadowy group shrouded in mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step he takes unravels a deeper conspiracy, forcing him to confront haunting truths about himself and the people around him. In this world, trust is scarce, and betrayal lurks in the shadows. How far would you go to protect those you love? And what are you willing to sacrifice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you guide Jack to freedom, or will his decisions drag him further into the darkness?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape Jack's journey, unlocking multiple endings that range from heartbreak to grim revelations. Each playthrough unveils new layers of a story steeped in themes of justice, guilt, and the weight of consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364120/extras/f4998e488851c2b862cf692933510fae.poster.avif?t=1744579811\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364120/extras/f4998e488851c2b862cf692933510fae.webm?t=1744579811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364120/extras/f4998e488851c2b862cf692933510fae.mp4?t=1744579811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Rich Narrative</strong>: Dive deep into an emotionally charged storyline that explores themes of justice, guilt, and redemption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong>: Your decisions impact the world around you, leading to different outcomes and consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices Matter</strong>: Every choice you make will have lasting repercussions, forcing you to weigh each decision carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate and Uncover Secrets</strong>: Solve intricate puzzles, explore mysterious environments, and uncover dark truths hidden in the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and Suspenseful Atmosphere</strong>: The game\u2019s haunting atmosphere and eerie environments will keep you on edge as you navigate its dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Sim</strong>: Engage with the world around you and make meaningful interactions that affect the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Puzzle-Solving</strong>: Solve complex puzzles while exploring a world full of secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the underground? The choice is yours, but be prepared for the consequences.</p>",
    "short_description": "Play as Jack in this first-person thriller where your choices determine his fate. Uncover dark secrets, solve puzzles, and navigate a world of mystery and emotional drama to save yourself and your daughter.",
