        "notes": "This game contains mature themes and disturbing content, including:\r\n1. Violence: There are violent acts, such as the protagonist being choked unconscious in a cutscene, and various threats against the lives of the protagonist and his daughter.\r\n2. Sexual Abuse: A letter from a female prisoner in the game details ongoing sexual abuse by prison guards. The game also references themes of torture and abuse.\r\n3. Psychological and Emotional Tension: The game builds intense psychological tension, with threats to the protagonist\u2019s and his daughter\u2019s lives, and an emotionally difficult choice at the game\u2019s climax regarding life and death.\r\n4. Disturbing Imagery: The game includes pixelated images of abused prisoners, some of which may contain nudity. The images are not clear but contribute to the game\u2019s dark and mature themes.\r\n5. Real-World Historical Content: The game is inspired by the real-life Abu Ghraib prison in Iraq, with references to actual events that occurred there in 2003, including abuse and torture, depicted in both images and audio logs."
